    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "RAY COOKE AUCTIONEERS proudly present this lovely five-bedroom detached property with a sunny south west facing rear garden in the exclusive 'Springbank' development ideally located in the heart of Saggart Village. Springbank is a mature & settled estate with a highly sought-after location based on many factors, the area is well serviced by excellent transport links from numerous bus routes to the Red Line Luas just a 5-minute walk away. There is a fine selection of schools in a close proximity as well as all the local amenities you can imagine including shops, eateries and recreational facilities including Rathcoole Park nearby.\nBright, airy and most spacious internal living accommodation of c. 139 sqm comprises of; entrance hallway, living room, fully fitted kitchen/dining area, separate utility room, two double bedrooms and family bathroom. On the first floor you have three double bedrooms (one walk in wardrobe) and main family bathroom.\nExternally to the rear of the property is a fully enclosed, private rear garden that's very well maintained and benefits from a sunny south west orientation. To the side you have a well-maintained outhouse and gym which is a great additional benefit to have, to the front you have ample off-street parking for a number of vehicles ideally positioned within a peaceful cul de sac with no passing traffic. No.19a is situated in one of Saggart's most sought after developments and comes to the market in fantastic condition throughout having been lovingly maintained by its current owners with no expense spared when upgrading in recent years with plenty of additional benefits such as generous living space, top quality fixtures & fittings, fully fitted kitchen and gas fired central heating to name but a few. This property truly needs to be viewed to appreciate the size and what this fantastic home has to offer. Call Ray Cooke Auctioneers for further information or to arrange viewing!\n\nAdditional Features;\n- 139 sqm\n- BER B3\n- 5 bedroom / 2 bathroom\n- Detached family home\n- Fantastic condition throughout\n- Tastefully decorated from top to bottom\n- Large living room\n- Fully fitted kitchen\n- Integrated appliances\n- Breakfast counter\n- Open plan kitchen/dining\n- Separate utility room\n- Five generous bedrooms\n- Top quality blinds\n- Walk in wardrobe\n- Two family bathrooms\n- Outhouse to the side\n- Gym\n- Sunny south west facing rear garden\n- Private & enclosed rear garden\n- Ample parking\n- Located on peaceful cul de sac\n- Family oriented estate\n- Close to all local amenities\n- Viewing is highly advised\n\nDirections coming off the N7 at the Rathcoole/Saggart junction, take the first exit onto Mill road towards Saggart. Take the second right hand turn onto Springbank and follow the road around to the left where number 19a will be at the end clearly sign posted."
      },
